{"articleNo":"1437","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1437&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▶▶해외인턴쉽 실시를 위한 수요조사◀◀[종료]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.10.15","hit":"10763","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&lt;&nbsp;해외인턴쉽 실시를 위한 수요조사&gt;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 84.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -84.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 84.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -84.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 목&nbsp;&nbsp; 적 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">우리대학에서 실시하는 교육역량강화사업의 일환으로 대학생들에게 다양한 해외</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 현장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 학습의 기회를 제공하여 글로벌 감각을 갖춘 핵심인재를 양성하기 위함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 대상국가 : 중국 천진</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 인 턴 처 : 중국 천진 한국상회에 가입회사</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 인턴기간 : 2010.12말 ~ 2011.02 중순(2~3개월)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 참여대상 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 우리대학에 재학중인 3학년, 4학년 대상(휴학자 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 해외여행에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전공무관</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 추후 인턴쉽 후 참여회사와 협의하여 취업 연계 기회제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 모집인원 : 20명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 선발기준</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 인원이 많을 경우 서류전형 및 면접 실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 성적우수자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 중국어 능력평가시험(HSK) 4급 이상자 우대</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">□ 지원 사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -